  "authored_scope": "Random scenes: width 12..30 (default 14..30), height 14..30 (default 18..30), any background colour, 2..4 bands of height 3..7 with one background row between them and 0..2 trailing rows, and 1..5 shapes (default 2..4). Shape kinds: solid, blob, notched block, hollow ring, two-colour ring (optionally divided), capsule, three-colour nest (synthetic), and stagger (synthetic: inner colour split into two blocks with different bottom rows, to exercise per-colour rather than per-component alignment). Sizes other than 24x30 are synthetic extensions. Deliberately not supported: shape colours with no matching band, same-colour stamps overlapping in a band, parts taller than their band (clipping), adjacent bands without a separator row, and shapes beside or below bands. Explicit scenes are validated against these invariants.",
  "authored_constraints": [
    "Band fills are unique; fill != end, and both != background",
