    "In random scenes, shapes sharing columns share no colour, so stamps never overlap",
    "Every shape colour is a band fill; in random scenes every band receives at least one part",
    "Every colour part's bounding-box height <= its band height (no clipping)",
    "Background is strictly the most frequent colour in the input"
